+//! Leptos' `view!` and `#[component]` write `::leptos` into the crate that
+//! uses them, and the layer supports two Leptos lines under names of its
+//! own; here the line is simply `leptos`. `mf2-leptos-ui-0-8` compiles the
+//! same source against Leptos 0.8 (Phase 10 A7; owner question 13).
